  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "みどりのひふは　みずにも　つよい。\nむかし　ほかのとちから　やってきて\nひとと　いっしょに　はたらいた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "녹색 피부는 물에도 강하다.\n오래전에 다른 지방에서 오게 되어\n사람과 함께 일했다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "綠色的皮膚非常耐水。\n在很久以前從其他地區過來，\n之後便一直與人類一起工作。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa peau verte résiste bien à l’eau.\nIl s’est installé dans la région il y a longtemps\net a travaillé en coopération avec les Hommes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Seine grüne Haut ist wasserresistent. Es kam\nvor langer Zeit aus einer anderen Region und\nverrichtete mit den Menschen Arbeiten.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su piel verdosa es resistente al agua. Proviene\nde tierras lejanas y presta ayuda a las personas\nen la realización de ciertos trabajos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La sua pelle verde è resistente all’acqua.\nOriginario di un’altra regione, è giunto a Galar\nin passato per lavorare insieme agli esseri umani.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They came over from another region long\nago and worked together with humans.\nTheir green skin is resistant to water.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "緑の皮膚は　水にも　強い。\n昔　ほかの土地から　やってきて\n人と　いっしょに　働いた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "绿色的皮肤非常耐水。\n在很久以前从其他地区过来，\n之后便一直与人类一起工作。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su piel verdosa es resistente al agua. Proviene\nde tierras lejanas y presta ayuda a las personas\nen la realización de ciertos trabajos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "むれを　つくって　くらしている。\nはなの　あくりょくは　おおいわも\nこなごなに　くだくほど　つよい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "무리를 지어 생활한다.\n코의 악력은 큰 바위도\n산산이 부술 정도로 강하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "群居的寶可夢。\n鼻子的握力十分強勁，\n甚至能把大石頭弄得粉碎。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ces Pokémon vivent en troupeau.\nL’étreinte de leur trompe est si forte qu’elle suffit\nà réduire un rocher en poussière.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Diese Pokémon leben in Herden. Drücken sie mit\nihren kräftigen Rüsseln zu, können sie selbst\nmassive Felsen zu Staub zermahlen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Viven en manadas. La fuerza prensil de su trompa\nes tan extraordinaria que le permite hacer añicos\nincluso grandes rocas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive in gruppo. La stretta della sua proboscide\nè così forte da mandare in frantumi anche le\nrocce più grandi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "These Pokémon live in herds. Their trunks have\nincredible grip strength, strong enough to crush\ngiant rocks into powder.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "群れを　つくって　暮らしている。\n鼻の　握力は　大岩も\n粉々に　砕くほど　強い。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "群居的宝可梦。\n鼻子的握力十分强劲，\n甚至能把大石头弄得粉碎。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Viven en manadas. La fuerza prensil de su trompa\nes tan extraordinaria que le permite hacer añicos\nincluso grandes rocas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "むかし　とおい　とちから　ひとにつれられ　やってきた。　ひこうきをかるがる　ひっぱる　ちからもち。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "과거 먼 곳에서 인간들이 데리고 왔다. 비행기도 가볍게 끌어당기는 천하장사.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在很久以前被人類從遙遠的地方帶來了這裡。是個能輕易拖動飛機的大力士。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon est originaire d’une région lointaine. On l’a amené à Paldea il y a bien longtemps. Il est si fort qu’il peut facilement tirer un avion.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vor langer Zeit haben Menschen es aus einer fernen Region mitgebracht. Es ist so stark, dass es selbst ein Flugzeug mühelos schleppen kann.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Llegó a Paldea hace mucho tiempo gracias a personas de una tierra lejana. Con su fuerza, puede arrastrar un avión sin problemas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Introdotto tempo fa nella regione da un luogo remoto, è dotato di una forza tale da poter trainare un aereo come nulla fosse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon was brought to Paldea long ago by people from a faraway land. It’s so strong that it can easily pull an airplane.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "昔　遠い　土地から　人に連れられ　やって来た。　飛行機を軽々　引っぱる　力持ち。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在很久以前，人类带着它从遥远的地方来到了这里。是个能轻松拖动飞机的大力士。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Llegó a Paldea hace mucho tiempo gracias a personas de una tierra lejana. Con su fuerza, puede arrastrar un avión sin problemas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "プライドが　たかく　きむずかしい。あざやかな　みどりの　ひふの　ものがなかまの　そんけいを　あつめる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "자존심이 강하고 성미가 까다롭다. 선명한 녹색 피부를 띠는 개체일수록 동료들에게 존경받는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "自尊心強，脾氣刁鑽。皮膚的綠色越是鮮豔，就越受到同伴的尊敬。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon très fier a plutôt mauvais caractère. Le vert éclatant de sa peau lui vaut le respect de ses congénères.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist sehr stolz und mürrisch. Exemplare mit leuchtend grüner Haut werden von ihren Artgenossen besonders stark respektiert.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es orgulloso y difícil de tratar. Aquellos con un tono de piel verde más vivo se ganan el respeto de sus congéneres.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha un’indole orgogliosa e stizzosa. I Copperajah con la pelle di colore verde acceso sono riveriti dai propri simili.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
